; Actual polynomial residual
; beta-alpha*[y]-[y]^2 and opposite factor (alpha+[y],1).
; Their mixed-product equation is a checked specialization
; of the actual quadratic multiplication calculation.
(#alias commutative-ring = ./commutative-ring-data.lim::commutative-ring)
(#alias
  coordinate-point-ideal-Y-class
